Thrilled to announce MIT CAST Virtual Visiting Artist Program.

00:00:06.353 --> 00:00:08.412
 

00:00:08.511 --> 00:00:10.150
Bringing together three of the most vibrant 

00:00:10.156 --> 00:00:11.593
artists in the musical scene today. 

00:00:23.088 --> 00:00:25.921
This year-long program involves a&nbsp;
symbiotic relationship between 

00:00:27.921 --> 00:00:30.676
the artists, MIT students, faculty, and community.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:34.844
Exploring&nbsp;new artistic and pedagogical terrain

00:00:34.844 --> 00:00:39.745
